<BRK/>
<ITM INDENT="-0.33">Perform at the manufacturer's facility before shipment to verify compressor performance and 
sound levels under controlled, factory conditions.  Obtain approval prior to shipping compressor.</ITM><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<ITM>Air Compressor <SUB>Performance Tests</SUB></ITM><BRK/>
<BRK/>
